# Design explorations

Overlay CSS layers — never edit base `style.css` for explorations:

1. Add `assets/css/<name>.css`, link it **after** `style.css` on `index.html`, `progress.html`, `404.html`.
2. Optional decorative `<div>` right after `<body>`.
3. Develop on `explore/<name>` branch off `main`; revert = remove the `<link>`.

**Live theme (2026-06):** `refined.css` on `main` — field-telemetry (LiDAR radar, robot blueprint, numbered sections). Unmerged reference branches: `explore/cyberpunk`, `explore/pyroscout-dark`.

## Preview

Pages use absolute `/assets/...` paths and JS-rendered content — **`file://` does not work**.

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8099   # open http://127.0.0.1:8099/
```

Compare branches with `git checkout <branch>` + refresh. Headless screenshots need a tall `--window-size` (e.g. 1440×6600) so `.reveal` sections are in view, plus `--virtual-time-budget=12000` for fonts/JS.
